 其二","author":"梅尧臣","text":"昔年同志逢时尽，今日相亲似子稀。\n犀仆忽辞云海上，远持双璧扣吾扉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66747,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"依韵和孙浦二都官展墓由大明精舍而归 其一","author":"梅尧臣","text":"新松烟翠入衣巾，雨后冈原不起尘。\n霜露悲怀今正切，曾非结客去寻春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66748,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"依韵和戏题","author":"梅尧臣","text":"扬州太守重交情，我欲西归未得行。\n寒食尚赊花水近，妻孥煎去到天明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66749,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"依韵和行之枇杷","author":"梅尧臣","text":"五月枇杷黄似橘，谁思荔枝同此时。\n嘉名已著上林赋，却恨红梅未有诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66750,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"依韵和行之都官芭蕉诗","author":"梅尧臣","text":"看取有心常不展，亦知随分坼佳葩。\n无端大叶映莲幕，却笑菖蒲罕见花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66751,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"依韵和达观师闻蝉","author":"梅尧臣","text":"饮馀晨露吸馀风，噪遍高枝为俗聋。\n欲比伯夷清已甚，不餐周粟腹常空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66752,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"依韵和吴正仲屯田重台梅花诗","author":"梅尧臣","text":"桃花已满秦人洞，杏树犹存董